.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/a3ff752bc079aa07a745cd78a9b58d39.poster.avif?t=1771015309\" width=850 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/a3ff752bc079aa07a745cd78a9b58d39.webm?t=1771015309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/a3ff752bc079aa07a745cd78a9b58d39.mp4?t=1771015309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 unique enemies and 170 variants \u2014 from lesser beasts to twisted abominations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 bosses with unique mechanics that demand real strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 schools of magic and 60+ spells \u2014 build lethal combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression of gear and skills, magic development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ random events and spicy encounters that change your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 collectible cards with explicit illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 atmospheric locations, each with its own style and dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique erotic scenes \u2014 interactive, upgradable, and with X-Ray</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/9211283fb60f682403e13cca5cd20e15.poster.avif?t=1771015309\" width=850 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/9211283fb60f682403e13cca5cd20e15.webm?t=1771015309\" type=\"video/webm